window.products.push({"id":148040,"name":"BRANO Under Cabinet Range Hood 30 Inch with Voice Control, 900 CFM Kitchen Hood Ducted Brushed Stainless Steel Vent Hood with LED Lights, Touch Contro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+N-fQPRhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HIGH QUALITY RANGE HOOD】: The under cabinet range hood is made of thicken brushed stainless steel that is durable, rust proof and easy to maintain. With tempered glass digital display which is easy to clean and slim body which is save space and very match your kitchen. Equipped with 4-speed fan, 3 control methods, 2 LED lights, 3min delay shutdown and 15min adjustable timer. Make you control your cooking needs flexible. 【VOICE CONTROL】: Upgraded voice control range hood allows you to achieve hands free completely. Not need to rely on your phone or other software to drive the voice assistant, just call your cooking partner \"Andy\" to help you execute the command after the power is plugged in. When you are washing vegetables, you not need to go to touch or hand wave control vent hood to switch functions. It is perfect to save your operation time, you can trust it to work no matter what time to use it. 【900 CFM STRONG SUCTION】: Powerful ducted range hood with dual ultra-quiet motor and 4 speed exhaust fan which allows you to choose the intensity of the air suction according the different cooking requirements. It can provide up to 900 CFM air suction for your cooking fumes, while keeping the noise low and always sustain its optimal efficiency to capture smoke and odors. Also the 3min delayed shut-off function will effectively removes residual harmful fumes and leave your kitchen with fresh air. 【EASY INSTALLATION】: Have 3 vent optional, including rectangular exhaust/round exhaust of the top, and rectangular exhaust in the back. Recommended 24'' to 30'' as the ideal distance from the countertop/stove to the bottom of the range hood, with a minimum 25.5'' for safety concern. A minimum of 6'' round duct (not included) or 9.75\"x 3.14\" Transition from rectangular connector to 6\" round duct (not included) must be used to maintain maximum airflow efficiency. 【WHAT YOU GET】: You will get a range hood, round sealing plate, round vent, manual and a pack of screws. The baffle filters are dishwasher friendly which will reduce your cleaning time and the stainless steel body can also be cleaned with a wet cloth with warm water. We provides with 10 years motor maintain and 5 years LED lights/switch maintain. Please according the product manual to install the range hood and please feel free to contact us if you need any assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+N-fQPRhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRANO","source_asin":"B0B77VB7SR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-148040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B77VB7SR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B77VB7SR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
