window.products.push({"id":148051,"name":"PUREPLUS ADQ36006101 Replacement for LG LT700P, Kenmore Elite 469690, ADQ36006102, Water Filters for Refrigerators LFXS30766S, LFX28968ST, LFX31925ST,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P+Wfjt5rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️Authoritative Certifications -The filter is certified by NSF/ANSI 42 for reducing chlorine, taste, and odor, and NSF/ANSI/CAN 372 for lead-free compliance. It removes 99% of chlorine, odor and improves water taste significantly. It also certified by European TUV, ROHS, REACH, Canadian CSA, BPA Free and Australian Water Mark. Only select products with authoritative certifications for your households. ❄️Innovated Multi-Layer Filtration Integrated Molding Tech- This Multi-layer technology offers different levels of filtration efficiency in filtering different contaminants. 0.5 Micron inner layer is effective against 99.99% Chlorine and meets Particular Reduction Class I standard. This filter retains beneficial minerals in water which is good to health. ❄️Strict Quality Control-All products are produced under the ISO9001 standard and inspected under strict quality control. Each filter is produced through 34 production processes, 400PSI pressure test, 10,000 water hammer tests, and 6 independent tests. ❄️Fits LG KENMORE Refrigerators - LFDS22520S, LFX21976ST, LFX25978ST, LFX25991ST, LFX28968ST, LFX28978ST, LFX31925ST, LFX31945ST, LFXC24726, LFXC24726D, LFXC24726S, LFXC24726S/03, LFXS24623S, LFXS29626S, LFXS29766S, LFXS30726S, LMXS27626S. ❄️Compatible Models -OEM LT700PC, KENMORECLEAR 46-9690, ADQ36006102-S, GENUINE ADQ36006102S, 9690, ADQ36006101-S, ADQ36006101S, WATERDROP WD-LT700P, WATER SENTINEL WSL-3, REFRESH R-9690, PURELINE PL-500, MAXBLUE MB-LT700P, K&J KJ700, ICEPURE PRO RWF1200AH, SEARS HDX FML-3, GOLDEN ICEPURE, GOLD SERIES GS-L3, GLACIER WF-117, FILTERLOGIC FL-RF32, EXCELPURE EP-LT700P, ECOAQUA EFF-6032A, DENALIPURE WF-LT700P, CRYSTALA CF15, AQUACREST AQF-LT700P, PURE GREEN PG700P, MIST LT700P FRIDGE CARTRIDGE. ❄️Why PUREPLUS -PUREPLUS has 20 years of expertise and 200 patents in the water filtration industry. Every year it provides filtration solutions to more than 200 million family worldwide, uses advanced filtration technology to ensure high quality water. Trust us, make PUREPLUS your resolution. ❄️Strict Quality Control-All products are produced under the ISO9001 standard and inspected under strict quality control. Each filter is produced through 34 production processes, 400PSI pressure test, 10,000 water hammer tests, and 6 independent tests. ❄️Easy to Install-Delicate design to fit the original brand. Easy for installation and operation. ❄️Cost-Effective -PUREPLUS is the most cost-effective brand. It sells 600 million filters worldwide every year, and can provide you with the best filtration performance with a more reasonable price. ❄️About TDS -Our filter cannot abviously lower the TDS value because it filters harmful substances while keeping beneficial minerals such as potassium, calcium, sodium, and magnesium, which is the main component of inorganic salts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P+Wfjt5rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PUREPLUS","source_asin":"B079TL9VW3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-148051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079TL9VW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B079TL9VW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false})