window.products.push({"id":148333,"name":"Hotfield 24 Inch Gas Cooktop Stainless Steel 4 Burners Stovetop Dual Fuel Gas Hob NG/LPG Convertible Gas Stove Top HF4258-03 Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ph-rL0QLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet All Cooking Needs - Note: This gas cooktop offers 3-year guarantee.This gas cooktop provides 5 different versatile burner sizes , triple ring 11262BTU burner, semi-rapid 9385BTU burner,two 5972BTU burners and an auxiliary 3413BTU burner. They will distribute even heat for simmer, boil, stir-frying, steaming, melting or others, which is very suitable for family daily use. Premium Quality - Made of food-grade stainless steel panel and durable parts including edge to edge heavy cast iron grates, wok support attachments for easy pans and pots maneuverability, one-second fast ignition system, heat resistant knobs, installation kit and LP conversion kit. Easy Maintenance: This stovetop is made with a 304 stainless steel surface, which is heat resistant and will not discolor. 5 sealed burners prevent food from falling into them. You can simply remove the grate and wipe it clean with water or detergent. Easy Installation - This stainless steel gas hob is drop-in type and can be installed quickly and easily.It is 110V AC pulse Ignition system and no battery required. The USA standard regulator and connector are included in the package. Easy To Operate - Automatic ignition via rotating control, flexible and accurate gas adjustment. Coming with LPG gas conversion kit, can be switched to liquefied gas to meet your needs.Natural gas nozzles are preset and can be replaced with LPG nozzles to meet your different needs. The regulator suitable for NG and LPG are offered for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ph-rL0QLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hotfield","source_asin":"B0BM9M66PZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-148333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM9M66PZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM9M66PZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
