window.products.push({"id":148370,"name":"DACHUANG Mini Washing Machine, 10L Foldable Laundry Tub Portable, Ultrasonic Turbine Washer by USB Powered, Compact Baby Clothes for Home Travel Apart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nb5QLoUnL._AC_.jpg","description":"🔔Warm Tips: 1.The mini washing machineneeds to use an adapter with an output power of 5V/5A to achieve the best performance (24W Power). 2.The mini washing machine is designed in a single-person style, suitable for personal laundry capacity, suitable for 2 kg laundry capacity(1-1.5KG is best capacity), please wash in batches if you have more clothes.The provided filter needs to be installed by yourself 3. The small washing machines are mainly used for washing small items and therefore do not have a dryer function. 4. When the turbo washing machine is rotating, please do not touch the fan blades of the turbo to avoid accidents. 5. Do not dip the USB power plug into water or other liquids to avoid short circuit and burn components. 6.When the portable washing machines is working, do not stay away from people. After washing, please unplug the power outlet immediately. Features of the mini washing machines: ✔️ ✔️Upgraded 24W Ultrasonic high frequency cavitation ✔️Portable foldable washing machine ✔️Intelligent interactive switching: After the pulsator works for 6 minutes, it exchanges for 2 minutes of ultrasonic work. ✔️Anti-winding technology: the washing machine will start ultrasonic work after being wound up and down 4 times. ✔️Forward and backward interaction: After the wave wheel rotates forward for 20 seconds, it is switched to reverse installation for 20 seconds. ✔️Timed shutdown protection: The washing machine works for over 40 minutes, and the shutdown program is automatically protected. 🧦Specifications of Portable Washer: - Casing Material: ABS - Material of the bucket: PP+TPE - Power Supply: USB - Input Voltage: DC 5V - Output Voltage: DC 12V - Output Power: 24W 🎁Package: 1 * Mini washing machine 1 * Foldable laundry bin1*Plastic Filter 1 * User manual 4 * Small suction cup 1 * USB cable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nb5QLoUnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DACHUANG","source_asin":"B0B1465H81","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-148370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1465H81","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1465H81","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
