window.products.push({"id":148489,"name":"Jolaxy 5231EL1003B Lint Filter Replacement for LG & Kenmore Dryers (Specific Models), Ultra Durable Dryer Lint Screen Trap with Felt Seal, Compatible ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uZYDPhypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REMINDER: This is 5231EL1003B filter, the size of which is 12.2 * 11.8 inch (31.0 * 29.9 cm). The 5231EL1003B filter HAS A FELT SEAL. In order to SELECT THE CORRECT FILTER, please MEASURE YOUR ORIGINAL FILTER SIZE and confirm WHETHER IT HAS A FELT SEAL before the purchase! If your original filter HAS A DIFFERENT SIZE or HAS NO FELT SEAL, this filter will NOT FIT YOUR DRYER! Compatibility: 5231EL1003B filter is not universal, it only works for LG and Kenmore dryers with Specific Model Numbers, and replaces part number 1266857, 5231EL1002E, 5231EL1003A, 5231EL1003C, 5231EL1003E, AH3527578, AP4440606, EA3527578, PS3527578. Part of the compatible model numbers have been listed in the description. If you are not sure whether this lint filter can work for your dryer, please feel free to contact us, we will help you confirm it. 100% Brand New and High Quality: A lint filter not only filters the air inside the dryer, but also traps any lint and debris. You need to replace the lint filter if the frame cracks or the screen gets a tear in it. This 5231EL1003B high-quality exact equivalent part is just right for the job, and will be an ideal replacement for your old, cracked or broken lint filter. More Efficiency: Featured with durable plastic construction, this filter can catch and trap lint for your dryer, which helps increase airflow to maximize drying efficiency and reduce drying times. Never operate the dryer without a lint filter in place. There is a felt seal along the rim for better performance, which can prevent air from escaping through the outer edge of the filter. Package Contents: 1 x 5231EL1003B Dryer Lint Filter (One-year Warranty)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uZYDPhypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jolaxy","source_asin":"B07XC45TYQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-148489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XC45TYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XC45TYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
