window.products.push({"id":148733,"name":"TRUSTECH Ice Maker - Stainless Steel Ice Machine, 8 Mins for 9 Ice Bullets with S/L Size, Easy to Use Ice Making Machine with LED Display, Timer, Ice ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZBvFf1fNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"6 MINS FOR 9 BULLETS - Want a cold drink but there is no ice? No need to run to a store. Our portable ice maker is fast and efficient, making 9 delicious, chewable, bullet shaped ice in one cycle, in average time 6 minutes. The water tank volume is 71oz and the ice storage capacity is up to 1.5lb. So TRUSTECH Ice Maker will make sure that the ice will always be in place for you SMALL & LARGE ICE BULLETS - TRUSTECH Ice Maker offers two sizes of ice bullets. You can choose large or small based on your preferences simply by selecting on LED control panel. The small ice bullets are easily fit in water bottle openings while large ice bullets are perfect for mixed drinks, iced food, and more SUPER QUIET &ENERGY EFFICIENT - TRUSTECH Ice Maker's compressor is powerful but quiet. Do not need to worry about too much noise. The ice machine is also environmentally friendly and energy efficient. When ice bucket is full, the ice machine will automatically stop and stand by. Any unused ice will melt into reservoir and be recycled. Everyone should contribute to protecting environment and energy saving. Let's start from the ice maker LED DISPLAY& INTELLIGENT FEATURES - TRUSTECH Ice Maker requires no installation, just simply plug in, add water, then wait for the fresh bullet shaped ice cubes. You will know everything from the high-quality LED display. The ice maker will let you know if it needs to be refilled or ice bucket is full. You can also use the Timer function to set up how long you want the ice machine to run ICE BUCKET & SCOOP - The ice bucket is removable, so if you need a large amount of ice, just simply take the bucket to wherever needed. You can also use ice scoop to easily fill glasses with ice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZBvFf1fNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRUSTECH","source_asin":"B07Q3FJHSF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-148733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q3FJHSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q3FJHSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
